        "gguAAQa34LU_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">It usually doesn't happen overnight.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">One year, you're the guy who's always in the mood.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">The next, you're coming home from work, eating dinner, putting the kids to bed, and falling asleep on the couch before 9.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Your wife wants to spend some time together.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">You love her. You're still attracted to her.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">But lately?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Sleep sounds better.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">And the strange part is, you can't really explain why.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">You used to think about sex all the time.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Now you can go days without thinking about it.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">You start wondering whether something is wrong with your testosterone.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Or whether this is simply what happens when a man turns 40.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">But what if you've been looking at only one piece of the problem?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Because sexual desire doesn't depend on testosterone alone.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">And understanding the other factors involved may be the first step toward figuring out what's changed.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
