        "gg2r3uVKVDo_text": "<p><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:15px;\"><i>\"I kept waiting for the crash. It's been my whole afternoon for so long I actually felt anxious when it didn't come — like I'd forgotten something. Week two I stopped waiting. It just wasn't coming anymore.\"</i></span></p>",
