        "gg4a9SxhVOS_text": "<p><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:15px;\"><i>\"I run a small construction crew. By 2pm I was basically just supervising from a lawn chair. Day thirteen I was on my feet the whole afternoon and didn't think about it once. My foreman asked if I was feeling okay. Said I seemed different. I told him I switched my coffee. He ordered some the next day.\"</i></span></p>",
        "gg5ooL1V-Ey_text": "<p><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:15px;\"><i>\"My teenage son asked me to throw the football on a Tuesday evening. I used to say maybe the weekend. Day nineteen I said sure and we were out there for forty minutes. He didn't say anything about it. I didn't either. But I noticed.</i></span></p>",
        "gg7_BTzj9HV_text": "<p>9</p>",
        "gg9-GQcvO3t_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">&nbsp;Think about a typical day for a busy dad.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">You wake up to an alarm.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Maybe you didn't sleep particularly well.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">You drink coffee and rush out the door.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">You spend the next eight or nine hours dealing with work.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Deadlines.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Traffic.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Phone calls.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Bills.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Then you come home.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">The kids need attention.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Dinner needs to be made.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">There's always something else that needs doing.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">And at the end of the day, you're supposed to suddenly switch from handling responsibilities to feeling relaxed, connected, and interested in intimacy.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">But your body doesn't operate in separate compartments.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Your sleep, stress levels, physical health, and emotional well-being can all influence how you feel.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">And that includes your sex drive.</span></p>",
        "gg9cd0fXZxF_label": "<p>👉 <strong><u>View current availability here</u>&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggAEy76n-Xp_text": "<p><span style=\"color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:14px;\"><strong>Jeff M</strong></span></p>",
        "ggAdvFInpkv_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Coffee_3_6b376c39-395d-4945-b8c0-2c8e43ca7e59.jpg",
        "ggAdvFInpkv_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Coffee_3_6b376c39-395d-4945-b8c0-2c8e43ca7e59.jpg",
